a,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- 다만, 다음의 사유에 대해서는 수강취소가 가능합니다. ⓐ </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">질병입원&nbsp;&nbsp;ⓑ</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">취업 및 현장실습&nbsp;ⓒ</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">군입대</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; *</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">인정서류 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">기관에서 발급한 증빙서류 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">입원확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">취업확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">입영통지서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">현장실습 신청자는 최종 합격확인서 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">지참</span></strong></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>* 위 사유에 해당되는&nbsp;[수강료 납부 후 취소신청기간에 대한 공지문]은 등록기간 종료 후 공지 예정임</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: non